/-!
# Native first Chern classes and the Néron--Severi image of the special tori

This checked package extends the genuine boundary-winding construction to
all original native holomorphic line bundles using proved analytic descent.
It includes presentation independence, native isomorphism invariance,
compatible-linear native pullback, the exact integral type `(1,1)` Chern
image, and `NS = ℤη` outside the proved countable exceptional set.

The genuine cup-square formulas use the specified positive real period
order. They imply that a native Chern class on a nonexceptional special
torus has zero square exactly when it is zero. No meromorphic-function,
algebraic-dimension, or complex-orientation comparison is assumed.
-/
